1
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:04,030
Previously on "Final Space"...

2
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:06,400
it's double trouble
aboard the Galaxy One

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:09,000
as the Lord Commander
and the Infinity Guard

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,710
are both gunning for our crew.

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:13,180
Little Cato is desperately
trying to contact his father --

6
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:15,710
Oh, no! --
and Quinn is about to unlock

7
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,580
a huge mystery
threatening Earth.

8
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:19,180
Oh, double no.

9
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,750
My slacks are tightening
just thinking about this.

10
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:24,750
Oh, triple no.

11
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:26,320
[ Alarm beeping ]

12
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:29,890
H.U.E.: Gary, you have 5 minutes
of oxygen left.

13
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:31,260
Gary:
I lived a good life.

14
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:34,000
Medium to good/
borderline crappy.

15
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:37,200
Saw some side boob once.
That was cool.

16
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:39,600
H.U.E., have you
ever seen side boob?

17
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,540
Side boob?
No, Gary.

18
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,940
The more you talk,
the more oxygen you --

19
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:47,340
You're missing out.
I guess it wasn't all that bad.

20
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,950
In fact, I take it back.
I lived a good one.

21
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,280
[ Alarm beeps rapidly ]

22
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,050
Of course! This is --

23
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:58,090
Thank you! My life sucks!

24
00:00:58,120 --> 00:01:07,100
♪♪

25
00:01:07,130 --> 00:01:16,110
♪♪

26
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:25,150
♪♪

27
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:29,050
Gary: This is where
Captain Gary wields

28
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:32,290
the great giant
scepter of power.

29
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:35,260
You're not a Captain.
Communication output requested.

30
00:01:35,290 --> 00:01:37,760
Requesting a communications
output, are we?

31
00:01:37,790 --> 00:01:40,460
You really know how
to press my buttons.

32
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:42,000
Press!
Ugh.

33
00:01:42,030 --> 00:01:45,330
Let me unpress your button
painfully short and clear.

34
00:01:45,370 --> 00:01:48,100
It is never going
to happen between us.

35
00:01:48,140 --> 00:01:49,410
Ever.

36
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:50,470
[ Thud! ]

37
00:01:50,510 --> 00:01:52,980
That was painfully short...
and clear!

38
00:01:53,010 --> 00:01:54,980
Come on, Quinn.
Why won't you give me a chance?

39
00:01:55,010 --> 00:01:57,310
You impersonated a member
of the Infinity Guard

40
00:01:57,350 --> 00:01:59,820
and blew up
92 Imperium Cruisers.

41
00:01:59,850 --> 00:02:01,850
That doesn't inspire
a lot of trust.

42
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:03,790
Then I guess this precious
thing we have between us

43
00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:06,160
is not gonna work out.
I'm sorry.

44
00:02:06,190 --> 00:02:09,330
Did you
just break up with me?
Quinn, it's over.

45
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:11,660
I pulled the Cupid's arrow out,
snapped it,

46
00:02:11,690 --> 00:02:13,460
and threw it into
the break-up flames.

47
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:16,670
Toast a marshmallow
and get on with your life.

48
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:18,600
I don't have time for this.
[ Sighs ]

49
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:21,100
I need to get the password
to the Infinity Guard network.

50
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:24,470
Does someone need the password
to the Infinity Guard network?

51
00:02:24,510 --> 00:02:26,640
How did you know?
How did I know?

52
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,940
I'm always listening.
Really?

53
00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,850
Can you stop that,
like, immediately?

54
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,880
Can I?

55
00:02:31,910 --> 00:02:34,080
No, I can't.

56
00:02:35,850 --> 00:02:37,650
There it is, H.U.E.
Zoom in.

57
00:02:37,690 --> 00:02:39,660
H.U.E.: The breach has
the characteristics

58
00:02:39,690 --> 00:02:41,020
of a black hole,

59
00:02:41,060 --> 00:02:42,360
and it's growing.

60
00:02:42,390 --> 00:02:44,060
You told
the Infinity Guard this

61
00:02:44,090 --> 00:02:46,830
and they didn't listen
and they want to arrest you?

62
00:02:46,860 --> 00:02:48,360
They're total bad guys.

63
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,530
That smell coming from
the Infinity Guard kitchen?

64
00:02:50,570 --> 00:02:53,240
A little dish
I call Corruption Stew!

65
00:02:53,270 --> 00:02:55,370
The Infinity Guard
is not corrupt.

66
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,710
I get it. You're mad
I broke up with you.

67
00:02:57,740 --> 00:02:59,540
My patience
is whittling away.

68
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:00,880
Whittle away,
temptress.

69
00:03:00,910 --> 00:03:02,650
Your words can't
hurt me anymore.

70
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,550
Wow. How pretty!
What is that?

71
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:07,680
Plasmic energy
is firing from that planet

72
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:09,690
directly into the breach.

73
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:12,820
If the laser continues,
the breach will widen,

74
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:15,390
and Earth will be consumed.

75
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:17,890
H.U.E., scan that planet
for inhabitants.

76
00:03:17,930 --> 00:03:20,830
That is
an Infinity Guard Outpost.

77
00:03:20,860 --> 00:03:22,730
It's not a soup.

78
00:03:22,770 --> 00:03:24,270
It's not a broth.

79
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:27,440
Oh! [ Chuckles ]
I know. It's a stew!

80
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:30,240
Corruption stew!

81
00:03:30,270 --> 00:03:32,210
There has to be
a good explanation.

82
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,680
We're going. H.U.E.,
prime the lightfold engines.

83
00:03:34,710 --> 00:03:36,550
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

84
00:03:36,580 --> 00:03:40,050
The moment we broke up, that
right went back to el capitan...

85
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,780
H.U.E., how do
we get to the surface?

86
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:44,090
...with a Captain's
finesse.

87
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:47,920
[ Screaming ]

88
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,430
Cutting the engines
and gliding in

89
00:03:49,460 --> 00:03:51,930
like a glorious coasting
stealth squirrel

90
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,700
was a bad idea!

91
00:03:53,730 --> 00:04:02,270
♪♪

92
00:04:02,310 --> 00:04:10,610
♪♪

93
00:04:10,650 --> 00:04:11,880
Good news.

94
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:13,620
If this is the right place,

95
00:04:13,650 --> 00:04:16,550
we're here.

96
00:04:16,590 --> 00:04:17,650
Assessing damage.

97
00:04:17,690 --> 00:04:20,290
The deflector array
is offline.

98
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:23,130
The power cells
are offline.

99
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,330
The bake shop is offline.

100
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,600
Wait! There's a bake shop
on this thing?!

101
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:29,330
Quinn: Avocato and I
will scout on foot.

102
00:04:29,370 --> 00:04:31,130
The rest of you stay back
and repair the ship.

103
00:04:31,170 --> 00:04:32,470
Come on, Avocato,
let's go.

104
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,640
What?!

105
00:04:33,670 --> 00:04:36,240
If I could pour
a tall glass of truth-juice

106
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:38,340
for you real quick,
Quinn --

107
00:04:38,370 --> 00:04:40,110
I am not feeling
the trust.

108
00:04:40,140 --> 00:04:41,980
I only trust three people
in this world --

109
00:04:42,010 --> 00:04:43,410
my dog, my sister,

110
00:04:43,450 --> 00:04:45,250
and every single member
of the Infinity Guard.

111
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:46,520
You're insane, my lady.

112
00:04:46,550 --> 00:04:48,980
The Infinity Guard
tried to kidnap you.

113
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:50,950
And they tried to take
over the Galaxy One.

114
00:04:50,990 --> 00:04:52,490
And dogs
aren't even people.

115
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:54,490
I have no reason
to trust any of you,

116
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:57,190
so I'm going with the guy
literally covered in guns.

117
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:01,130
KVN, fix the ship.

118
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,700
Also, don't touch
any of my stuff.

119
00:05:02,730 --> 00:05:05,670
Or Quinn's stuff. Or Avocato's.
Or the cookies. Ju--

120
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:08,370
Jus-- Just don't touch anything.
Specifically buttons.

121
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,610
And especially
flamethrowers.

122
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,980
But do fix the ship,
and then die.

123
00:05:13,010 --> 00:05:15,680
Okay? [ Chuckles ] Okay.
Okay, come on, Mooncake!

124
00:05:15,710 --> 00:05:19,520
Wow!
[ Laughs ]

125
00:05:19,550 --> 00:05:20,680
Ugh.

126
00:05:23,090 --> 00:05:28,520
[ Laughs maniacally ]

127
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,860
[ Giggles ] Hooray!

128
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:32,130
[ Clanging ]

129
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:34,460
[ Chuckles ]

130
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,500
Watch this.

131
00:05:35,530 --> 00:05:36,870
[ Smooching ]

132
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:39,030
Stop!
Stop staring.

133
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:41,740
Flamethrowers! Hooray!

134
00:05:41,770 --> 00:05:42,810
I'm burning things!

135
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,710
[ Giggles ]

136
00:05:44,740 --> 00:05:46,910
S.A.M.E.S.:
Wait, what? Aah.

137
00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:50,550
[ Rumbling in distance ]

138
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:52,420
Little Cato: Dad,
these are my coordinates.

139
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:54,180
Come find me.
[ Beep ]

140
00:05:54,220 --> 00:05:57,850
Stupid thing won't work!
[ Grunts ]

141
00:05:57,890 --> 00:06:00,390
Be brave.
Huh?

142
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:03,260
We're going to
get you out of here.

143
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:10,070
Why should I trust you?
We share the same enemy.

144
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:11,830
I gotta send a message
to my father.

145
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:13,400
Can you amplify
my signal?

146
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:16,710
There's a transmitting station.
I can show you the way.

147
00:06:16,740 --> 00:06:17,940
Now run!

148
00:06:17,970 --> 00:06:21,240
♪♪

149
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,410
Chocli.

150
00:06:25,450 --> 00:06:27,280
[ Laughs ]

151
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:31,420
Ooh!

152
00:06:31,450 --> 00:06:36,860
♪♪

153
00:06:36,890 --> 00:06:42,230
♪♪

154
00:06:42,260 --> 00:06:44,100
Hey, man-- Oh!
Oh, my gosh!

155
00:06:44,130 --> 00:06:46,600
You just don't cleave everybody
in the neck meat, Avocato!

156
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:48,540
What the freak?!

157
00:06:48,570 --> 00:06:50,540
Let me give you
some advice, buddy.

158
00:06:50,570 --> 00:06:53,110
Yes.
If you want Quinn
to trust you,

159
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:55,210
you gotta step up
and show her you can lead.

160
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,910
Make direct eye contact,

161
00:06:56,950 --> 00:07:00,480
then don't let go until you kiss
her soul with your eyelashes.

162
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:02,120
Like this.

163
00:07:02,150 --> 00:07:04,790
Too much, or just enough?

164
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:08,090
Oh, my wow. Oh, my wow!
It's glorious!

165
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:10,730
Yeah. So you got it?
I got it. It's done.

166
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:11,760
Done and done.

167
00:07:11,790 --> 00:07:14,300
Hi, Quinn.

168
00:07:14,330 --> 00:07:17,430
Too little,
or just enough?

169
00:07:17,470 --> 00:07:18,670
Ahhhh!

170
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:19,970
Just go back to the ship.

171
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,400
You're not
a trained soldier.

172
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:24,170
You're a...nobody.
[ Chuckles ] Okay.

173
00:07:24,210 --> 00:07:25,910
I didn't expect
that hurt coin deposit

174
00:07:25,940 --> 00:07:28,140
in my sadness savings.
Good Lord.

175
00:07:28,180 --> 00:07:30,610
Look, Gary, I'm not
trying to be mean.

176
00:07:30,650 --> 00:07:32,480
If you get hurt or die --

177
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:35,350
Well, that's a responsibility
I don't want.

178
00:07:35,380 --> 00:07:37,950
That's just the truth.
I don't accept your truth.

179
00:07:37,990 --> 00:07:39,150
And that was
incredibly mean.

180
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:40,760
I'm sorry.
I don't think you are.

181
00:07:40,790 --> 00:07:42,930
You're right.
I'm not.

182
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,660
You have a bite to you.
I like that.

183
00:07:44,690 --> 00:07:47,030
I promise, you will
end up trusting me.

184
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:49,500
And revel in
my awesomeness as I...

185
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:52,500
karate chop this magnificent --
[ Vocalizing ] --

186
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:54,000
disturbingly agile...

187
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,970
freaking bug angel!

188
00:07:57,970 --> 00:07:59,470
I think that thing
just bit me.

189
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:01,510
[ High-pitched voice ] Ahhhhhh!
-Holy crap!

190
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:04,050
It's a beautiful nightmare
shrinking demon!

191
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,720
[ Roars ]
Aah!

192
00:08:09,750 --> 00:08:11,790
Hoorah!

193
00:08:11,820 --> 00:08:13,360
Stay with me, Avocato!
Aah!

194
00:08:13,390 --> 00:08:15,620
I won't rest until
a cure is found.

195
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:18,130
[ Grunts ]

196
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:20,030
Mooncake,
give Avocato a ride.

197
00:08:20,060 --> 00:08:21,330
Aah!

198
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,200
Mooncake: Mmmmm-hmmmm!

199
00:08:23,230 --> 00:08:26,700
Whoa!

200
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:28,300
I got your back, Mooncake!

201
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:30,670
Yee-haw!

202
00:08:30,710 --> 00:08:32,240
[ Pew! Pew! Pew! ]

203
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:33,710
[ Laughs ] What was that?!
I mean, wha-- like a little--

204
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:35,980
a little silly string
shooting out of your gun?

205
00:08:36,010 --> 00:08:38,380
Like...
[ Laughs ] I mean, that's --

206
00:08:38,410 --> 00:08:39,750
that's like --
What were you even

207
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:41,050
trying to accomplish
right there?

208
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:43,690
I mean --
Okay, foll-follow me!

209
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,520
[ Grunts ]

210
00:08:45,550 --> 00:08:53,330
♪♪

211
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:55,100
Spider!
Spider!

212
00:08:55,130 --> 00:08:58,230
It's a spider!

213
00:08:58,270 --> 00:08:59,770
Ohhh, it's a spider!

214
00:09:01,770 --> 00:09:04,410
Aah! Oh! [ Grunts ]

215
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,440
Aah!

216
00:09:05,470 --> 00:09:08,880
That's weird.
It says we're...here?

217
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:10,750
Dear Heavenly
Lightning Lord!

218
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:12,110
Are you not seeing this?!

219
00:09:12,150 --> 00:09:14,850
Seeing what?

220
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:15,780
Ugh.

221
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:16,850
It's right here.

222
00:09:16,890 --> 00:09:20,090
Seeing...this.

223
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,590
What the hell
is that thing?

224
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:26,290
♪♪

225
00:09:26,330 --> 00:09:27,730
Are you talking about
the giant laser?

226
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,360
Because if you're talking
about the giant laser,

227
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,770
it's a giant laser.

228
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:32,400
I know it's a giant laser.

229
00:09:32,430 --> 00:09:35,940
Giant doesn't even begin
to describe what I'm seeing.

230
00:09:35,970 --> 00:09:41,540
[ Alarm blaring in distance ]

231
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:42,780
[ Whirring ]

232
00:09:42,810 --> 00:09:45,450
Computer:
Laser activation commencing.

233
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:50,790
♪♪

234
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:55,820
♪♪

235
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:58,760
That's what's been creating
the gravitational disturbance.

236
00:09:58,790 --> 00:10:00,460
I thought the Earth
was being sucked

237
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:02,770
into a black hole,
but I was wrong.

238
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:05,070
This whole thing is
being orchestrated --

239
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:06,800
By who?
Or is it whom?

240
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:10,810
Either way, it's probably
by some serious bad guy.

241
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:15,010
What a twist!

242
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,310
Infinity Guard Army:
For the galaxy!

243
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:19,350
For eternity!
For Lord Commander!

244
00:10:19,380 --> 00:10:23,950
With each blast, we get
closer to Final Space!

245
00:10:23,990 --> 00:10:25,650
So, keep it up.

246
00:10:25,690 --> 00:10:29,790
Good job, Jeff.
Hearing great things.

247
00:10:29,830 --> 00:10:31,460
Yes!

248
00:10:31,490 --> 00:10:33,330
How the hell
do I turn this off?

249
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:35,960
Eric!
How do I turn this off?

250
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:39,270
Is it the red knob?
Do I turn it left?

251
00:10:39,300 --> 00:10:42,040
Eric, stop crying!

252
00:10:42,070 --> 00:10:44,270
I'm just going to walk away.

253
00:10:44,310 --> 00:10:45,770
The Lord Commander.

254
00:10:45,810 --> 00:10:48,110
He's taken over
the Infinity Guard.

255
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,510
They're destroying
Earth.

256
00:10:49,540 --> 00:10:52,050
They're --
Corrupt! Told ya!

257
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,520
Now do you trust me?

258
00:10:53,550 --> 00:10:57,050
No. Now I'm the only person
I can trust.

259
00:10:57,090 --> 00:11:00,160
And Gary. You left out Gary.
And Hot Wheels Avocato.

260
00:11:00,190 --> 00:11:03,190
What I lack in size
I make up for in wisdom.

261
00:11:03,230 --> 00:11:04,530
So now that you're tiny

262
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:06,290
you're like the new Socrates
or something?

263
00:11:06,330 --> 00:11:09,630
Whatever. C'mon, squad.
She needs backup!

264
00:11:09,660 --> 00:11:10,470
[ Grunts ]

265
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:11,870
Oh, well, I guess not.

266
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:15,000
I guess I could just sit here
and pop my lips.

267
00:11:15,040 --> 00:11:16,470
[ Pop! Pop! ]

268
00:11:16,500 --> 00:11:16,770
[ Pop! ]

269
00:11:20,940 --> 00:11:22,240
♪ Burning love

270
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,910
♪ Burning love,
hot burning love ♪

271
00:11:24,950 --> 00:11:27,920
♪ Love, love,
love burning love ♪

272
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:29,520
Beth, I want you to know

273
00:11:29,550 --> 00:11:31,890
that this has been the happiest
moment of KVN's life.

274
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:33,520
I can see it
on your face.

275
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:34,420
We are so happy.

276
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:36,390
-She is so hot.
-Stop!

277
00:11:36,420 --> 00:11:38,530
Stop staring.
So creepy.

278
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:40,260
Now do my bidding!
Fix the ship.

279
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:43,200
I will kill KVN
and take Beth for my own.

280
00:11:43,230 --> 00:11:44,900
Over my cold,
dead hands.

281
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:47,200
Death fight.
We've got a death fight.

282
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,900
Now, where were we?

283
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:50,940
[ Lasers blasting ]

284
00:11:50,970 --> 00:11:54,780
♪♪

285
00:11:54,810 --> 00:11:56,440
How the hell
does Jeff do it?

286
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,610
[ Sighs ]

287
00:11:57,650 --> 00:12:01,680
♪♪

288
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,420
[ Grunting ]

289
00:12:03,450 --> 00:12:04,450
Aah!

290
00:12:04,490 --> 00:12:07,220
Ugh.

291
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:09,460
I told you,
I'm doing this on my own.

292
00:12:09,490 --> 00:12:11,790
The hell you are.
Like it or not, we're a team.

293
00:12:11,830 --> 00:12:15,200
And you can't spell "team"
without "M" and "E",

294
00:12:15,230 --> 00:12:16,870
and you know
what that spells...

295
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:17,900
"Us."

296
00:12:17,930 --> 00:12:19,270
Fine.
Fine.

297
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:22,070
A job worth doing is
worth doing together.

298
00:12:22,100 --> 00:12:23,310
Thank you, Avocato.

299
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:25,270
But a vision
becomes a nightmare

300
00:12:25,310 --> 00:12:28,280
when the leader has
a big dream and a bad team!

301
00:12:28,310 --> 00:12:30,310
Okay, okay! Shut up
with that stuff.

302
00:12:30,350 --> 00:12:32,380
I don't even know what
you're talking about.

303
00:12:32,410 --> 00:12:34,720
Computer: Laser activation
in four minutes.

304
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:37,950
Geez. Oh, my gosh.

305
00:12:37,990 --> 00:12:41,590
Superior Stone,
that bastard.

306
00:12:43,530 --> 00:12:45,090
Come on, we're
running out of time.

307
00:12:45,130 --> 00:12:46,560
We gotta go around.

308
00:12:46,590 --> 00:12:49,600
♪♪

309
00:12:49,630 --> 00:12:52,470
Ohhhh, crap.

310
00:12:55,270 --> 00:12:58,640
Aah! Laser hell --
[ Whispering ] Shhh!
The walls are thin.

311
00:12:58,670 --> 00:13:00,810
Do not make a sound,
or they'll hear us!

312
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,580
[ Whispering ]
You expect us -- Ow! --

313
00:13:02,610 --> 00:13:04,450
to climb through
this electric pain-maze

314
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,750
without making a sound?

315
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:06,820
We're not wizards.

316
00:13:06,850 --> 00:13:07,920
Ow!

317
00:13:07,950 --> 00:13:10,350
Will everyone
please shut up!

318
00:13:10,390 --> 00:13:11,490
Aah!

319
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:12,820
Okay!
We'll do it your --

320
00:13:12,860 --> 00:13:13,960
Ohhhhh!

321
00:13:13,990 --> 00:13:16,460
Aa-ga-gaah!
Aa-ga-gaah!

322
00:13:16,490 --> 00:13:18,790
Right on
the downstairs mustache.

323
00:13:18,830 --> 00:13:21,000
Do you not see
this is the worst possible

324
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:22,830
ti-i-i-ime
for this?!

325
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:23,970
Tuff titty whompas!

326
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,700
Company hold.
Titty whompas!

327
00:13:25,730 --> 00:13:28,670
Did you hear that?
Sounded like
"tuff titty whompas."

328
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:31,710
What the hell is
a tuff titty whompas?

329
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:35,210
It's probably a rat.
Do rats say
"tuff titty whompas"?

330
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,880
The big ones do.

331
00:13:39,980 --> 00:13:42,180
Oh!

332
00:13:42,220 --> 00:13:43,990
[ Laughs ]

333
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:45,390
Oh, my God! Aah!

334
00:13:45,420 --> 00:13:48,220
You're like a tiny
little Avocato bobble head!

335
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:49,690
[ Laughs ]

336
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:50,960
Aah!

337
00:13:50,990 --> 00:13:55,960
♪♪

338
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:58,130
Alert! Escapee.
Lock it down!
[ Alarm blares ]

339
00:13:58,170 --> 00:14:00,170
[ Guard screams ]

340
00:14:02,070 --> 00:14:03,840
Now run!
Ya think?

341
00:14:03,870 --> 00:14:07,480
♪♪

342
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:10,780
Computer: Laser activation
in 90 seconds.

343
00:14:12,950 --> 00:14:14,420
[ Guns cock ]

344
00:14:14,450 --> 00:14:16,180
Have you all
lost your minds?!

345
00:14:16,220 --> 00:14:18,090
You're working for
the Lord Commander!

346
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,420
We're Infinity Guard --

347
00:14:19,450 --> 00:14:21,590
the last vestige of hope
in the universe.

348
00:14:21,620 --> 00:14:24,760
What you're doing here
is going to destroy the Earth,

349
00:14:24,790 --> 00:14:26,590
our home.

350
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:29,600
Stop this.
I'm begging you.

351
00:14:29,630 --> 00:14:32,100
Stop.

352
00:14:32,130 --> 00:14:34,770
That's a good speech,
but, nah.

353
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:35,570
Nah, ain't happening.

354
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:39,570
[ Guards chatter, laugh ]

355
00:14:42,140 --> 00:14:44,250
Yeah, no,
we're not stopping.

356
00:14:45,410 --> 00:14:47,220
You know what to do,
Avocato. Hoorah!

357
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:54,090
♪♪

358
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:58,030
I'm back, baby!
Whoo! Yeah!

359
00:14:58,060 --> 00:15:00,530
I'm electrified, baby!

360
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:04,130
Whoo! Murder Beam activate!
Yeah! Oh, yeah!

361
00:15:04,170 --> 00:15:07,970
I go high, you go low!
Yes!

362
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:13,210
Yeah! Gary, how're them
guns back there?

363
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:15,840
They're hot, baby!

364
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:19,150
Yes!

365
00:15:19,180 --> 00:15:23,520
♪♪

366
00:15:27,490 --> 00:15:30,060
Stone! You traitor!

367
00:15:30,090 --> 00:15:34,600
What I do, I do
for the Infinity Guard!

368
00:15:34,630 --> 00:15:37,170
You double-crossing
sphincter sack.

369
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:40,470
Quinn,
you can still join us.

370
00:15:40,500 --> 00:15:42,070
You're just about
the only one

371
00:15:42,100 --> 00:15:47,340
who hasn't pledged allegiance
to the Lord Commander.

372
00:15:47,380 --> 00:15:50,350
Don't do it, Quinn!
Don't do it!

373
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:52,850
We have such a good thing
going here!

374
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:55,320
I'm not joining him,
you freaking weirdo.

375
00:15:55,350 --> 00:15:59,150
Don't join forces
with this guy!

376
00:15:59,190 --> 00:16:01,090
Don't do it!

377
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,660
Why are you doing this?

378
00:16:02,690 --> 00:16:05,790
The Lord Commander has seen
what's on the other side.

379
00:16:05,830 --> 00:16:08,760
Once we break into
Final Space,

380
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:11,970
we'll flood the world
with light,

381
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:15,370
and there will be
no more death.

382
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:17,540
That's because there
will be no more life.

383
00:16:17,570 --> 00:16:20,380
At first.
But not at second.

384
00:16:20,410 --> 00:16:23,210
And don't even get me
started on thirdly.

385
00:16:23,250 --> 00:16:26,680
Anyway, Quinn,
we should thank you.

386
00:16:26,710 --> 00:16:27,850
What?

387
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:29,620
Your scribbling
on a bar napkin allowed us

388
00:16:29,650 --> 00:16:31,890
to finally break through
the quantum barriers

389
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:34,390
and tear through
this universe.

390
00:16:34,420 --> 00:16:37,890
So you see,
this is all your work.

391
00:16:43,570 --> 00:16:44,870
Cheer up.

392
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:48,540
You won't have to live
with the guilt much longer...

393
00:16:50,710 --> 00:16:52,570
...because now
there's no stopping us

394
00:16:52,610 --> 00:16:56,810
from tearing a hole
into Final Space.

395
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:59,850
Computer: Commencing laser fire
in 30 seconds.

396
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:03,190
Hey, sphincter sack!
Rock, paper, scissors.

397
00:17:03,220 --> 00:17:05,190
I'm not
playing this game.

398
00:17:05,220 --> 00:17:07,220
Close! Paper!

399
00:17:10,690 --> 00:17:12,890
Aah!

400
00:17:12,930 --> 00:17:16,600
[ Chuckles ] Guy just got sucked
into a big ol' butthole.

401
00:17:16,630 --> 00:17:18,500
Gary, we got
a laser to take out.

402
00:17:18,530 --> 00:17:20,030
Okay!
Okay, let's go!

403
00:17:20,070 --> 00:17:22,040
It's all my fault.

404
00:17:22,070 --> 00:17:23,570
Quinn,
it's not your fault.

405
00:17:23,610 --> 00:17:26,540
I can't even trust
myself anymore.

406
00:17:26,570 --> 00:17:29,210
Okay, you're digging deep,
and there's some real powerful

407
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,750
self-discovery stuff
going on here,

408
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:33,420
but there's a giant laser
about to fire,

409
00:17:33,450 --> 00:17:35,520
so if we could just
stick a pin in this

410
00:17:35,550 --> 00:17:37,390
and pick it up
over snacks soon-ish?

411
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:40,460
Laser activation
in 10 seconds.

412
00:17:40,490 --> 00:17:43,530
Stone shot out the controls.
The laser can't be stopped.

413
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:45,460
Laser activation
commencing now.

414
00:17:45,490 --> 00:17:46,690
Mooncake,
shoot the laser!

415
00:17:46,730 --> 00:17:48,400
Are you crazy?
Yes! Shoot the laser!

416
00:17:48,430 --> 00:17:49,530
-Chocli.
-Shoot the laser!

417
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:50,570
-Chocli?
-Shoot the laser!

418
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:51,900
-Chocli!
-Shoot it! Shoot it!

419
00:17:51,930 --> 00:17:53,900
-Shoot the laser!
-Chocli!

420
00:17:53,940 --> 00:18:03,280
♪♪

421
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:06,650
Ooh...
-Oh. My. Crap.

422
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:12,250
The elevator! Hurry!

423
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:17,460
[ All screaming ]

424
00:18:17,490 --> 00:18:18,790
Tuff titty whompas!

425
00:18:18,830 --> 00:18:21,630
KVN? H.U.E.? We need
an emergency extraction!

426
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:27,770
Whoa!
Mooncake!

427
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:32,970
♪♪

428
00:18:33,010 --> 00:18:38,280
♪♪

429
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:39,510
Aah!

430
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:40,950
[ Gasps ]

431
00:18:43,890 --> 00:18:45,950
We're going to die!

432
00:18:45,990 --> 00:18:47,620
Not if you trust me.

433
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:49,120
I'm sorry.

434
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,690
I can't.

435
00:18:50,730 --> 00:18:53,760
I think you can.

436
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:54,630
Okay.

437
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:56,960
Okay.
And don't worry.

438
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,370
I have one of these.

439
00:18:59,830 --> 00:19:03,610
Aaah!

440
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:06,870
Aah! Why would they
connect the nerve endings

441
00:19:06,910 --> 00:19:09,540
to my robot hand?!

442
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:10,810
Aah!

443
00:19:10,850 --> 00:19:12,010
Whyyyy?!

444
00:19:12,050 --> 00:19:14,050
Aah!

445
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:17,020
Whoa!

446
00:19:17,050 --> 00:19:18,220
Aah!

447
00:19:18,250 --> 00:19:20,560
Aah! Whoa!

448
00:19:20,590 --> 00:19:21,890
Gary:
When I woke up this morning,

449
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:23,830
I did not think,
"I'm going to die."

450
00:19:23,860 --> 00:19:26,960
But look at us.
Look at me, look at her.

451
00:19:26,990 --> 00:19:30,630
Here we are. A unit.
Dying together.

452
00:19:30,670 --> 00:19:33,340
Oh, no, wait!
Look, the Galaxy One! Yeah!

453
00:19:33,370 --> 00:19:34,870
Gary: Aah!

454
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:36,070
♪♪

455
00:19:36,100 --> 00:19:37,340
Oh!

456
00:19:37,370 --> 00:19:44,210
♪♪

457
00:19:44,250 --> 00:19:45,550
You came through.

458
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:48,620
Woman: I told you --
we fight the same war.

459
00:19:50,220 --> 00:19:52,850
[ Beeping ]
But it's key locked.

460
00:19:52,890 --> 00:19:56,390
43728.

461
00:19:56,420 --> 00:19:57,530
[ Computer chimes ]
[ Chuckles ]

462
00:19:57,560 --> 00:20:00,260
I'm in.
Thanks. I owe you.

463
00:20:00,300 --> 00:20:02,730
Dad, these are my coordinates.
Come find me.

464
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:04,100
I mean, at your leisure,

465
00:20:04,130 --> 00:20:05,530
but like, for me,
preferably fast.

466
00:20:05,570 --> 00:20:06,730
That'd be great.

467
00:20:06,770 --> 00:20:08,200
And...send!

468
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:11,240
You did it! You did!

469
00:20:11,270 --> 00:20:14,380
[ Voice deepens ]
You -- You did it!

470
00:20:14,410 --> 00:20:19,510
You sent your father
and Mooncake right to me.

471
00:20:19,550 --> 00:20:21,720
No, no, no, no, nooooo!

472
00:20:21,750 --> 00:20:28,060
♪♪

473
00:20:28,090 --> 00:20:34,460
♪♪

474
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:37,300
What, uh...
what are you doing?

475
00:20:37,330 --> 00:20:38,630
Starting over.

476
00:20:38,670 --> 00:20:40,300
You were right
about everything.

477
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:42,440
I know.
It's a blessing.

478
00:20:42,470 --> 00:20:44,540
And my curse.

479
00:20:44,570 --> 00:20:46,570
If the Lord Commander
corrupted the Infinity Guard

480
00:20:46,610 --> 00:20:49,580
it means there's
no good guys left.

481
00:20:49,610 --> 00:20:51,110
Yes, there are.

482
00:20:51,150 --> 00:20:52,250
Who?

483
00:20:52,280 --> 00:20:53,420
-Us.
-Chocli.

484
00:20:53,450 --> 00:20:55,620
Healthy people trust.

485
00:20:55,650 --> 00:20:58,090
We need more of that,
not less.

486
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:59,620
But how can I?

487
00:20:59,650 --> 00:21:02,120
You begin right here...

488
00:21:04,430 --> 00:21:06,430
...with this guy.

489
00:21:06,460 --> 00:21:09,960
We're the good guys now.

490
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,930
Okay, then.

491
00:21:11,970 --> 00:21:13,170
Us.

492
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:14,340
Yeah.

493
00:21:14,370 --> 00:21:16,000
Us.

494
00:21:16,040 --> 00:21:18,910
[ Chuckles ] Oh, KVN!

495
00:21:18,940 --> 00:21:23,780
What in the three rings of hell
did you do to the ship?!
